/*
 * URLDocumentClass owner, object/view/frame templates, document lifecycle,
 * UI attachment, pending/completion coordination and integration handlers.
 * URLDocumentHistory.goc owns history snapshots and navigation stacks;
 * URLDocumentNavigation.goc owns URL/frameset and navigation commands.
 * URLDocumentLocalPage.goc owns local-page persistence. External registrations remain
 * here in their original order; the command split shares URLDocument_TEXT.
 * History stack buffers are allocated/freed in the unchanged open/close
 * handlers so their ordering with the document/cache lifetime stays intact.
 */

